From 7c14092ffb50622f78f9c466d92f2a6c0fce71a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dhruv Mark Collins <mark@igalia.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:26:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ir3: Only prefetch UBO descriptors

Prefetching texture and sampler descriptors in the preamble costs more
than it saves on A750. Each one adds a dummy sam or resinfo to a preamble
that runs once per draw, and once per bin under GMEM.

On a Half-Life: Alyx trace, prefetching only UBO descriptors is 1.9%
faster than the current default and matches disabling the prefetch
entirely. Two other Alyx scenes and Stray were neutral within noise, and
the UBO prefetches did not cost anything measurable, so they are kept.

Signed-off-by: Dhruv Mark Collins <mark@igalia.com>
Generated-by: LLM
